    // layer, because WHICH ONE A WEIGHT WANTS IS A PROPERTY OF THE WEIGHT and the pack mixes them by layer -
    // `attn_qkv` alone is IQ4_XS on 13 layers, Q3_K on 18, Q4_K on 4 and S2 on 1.
